    <div class="infor-wrap">
        <div class="note">This section provides information for licencees, prospective licencees, Reporting Issuers and persons interested in issuing securities on the Eastern Caribbean Securities Market (ECSM).<br/><br/>
        All individuals who wish to engage in carrying on regulated activities or in the conduct of securities business within the Eastern Caribbean Securities Market must be licensed with the ECSRC.<br/><br/>
        Want to sell your shares to the public? Interested in purchasing shares? Want to find out more about a company? Then this is the section for you.</br/><br/>
            See below list of <b>ALL COMPANIES</b> that are registered with the ECSRC.</div>
